==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 7 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

Bring [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]], [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]]. You can use [[Cat Combo]]s to increase the effectiveness of the [[Cat Cannon]] or the damage of your cats if you want. Upgrade the [[Worker Cat]] and, once the enemies are in front of the [[Cat Base]], start spamming the attackers. Once the Condemned Peng arrives, spam the two cheapest meatshields too. Later, spam the non-Crazed meatshields and the attackers while you approach the enemy base. Although the enemies are strong, your meatshields will hold them back long enough for the Cannon to do most of the work regardless of the level of your cats. While they slowly push from their base to yours, only spam Crazed Sexy Legs, the meatshields and the cannon. Even with cats at level 2, the penguins will die in time, allowing you to build your army back up and take the enemy base.

